222
00:22:23,441 --> 00:22:24,722
[SPEAKER_03]: No, it's not entirely.

223
00:22:24,762 --> 00:22:34,429
[SPEAKER_03]: So, your actions, your intentions, your livelihood, all of that built up is contributing towards sustaining this up until it cannot be otherwise.

224
00:22:35,630 --> 00:22:36,231
[SPEAKER_03]: The non-self.

225
00:22:42,707 --> 00:22:58,918
[SPEAKER_00]: So, would it be correct to say that it's important to, for example, if you want to contemplate the element of earth in regard to the body, to do that while seeing

226
00:23:00,202 --> 00:23:10,469
[SPEAKER_00]: The body as where your sense of self is, if you know what I mean like that, the... you don't take it as something separate from your sense of self.

227
00:23:10,669 --> 00:23:11,310
[SPEAKER_00]: I would...

228
00:23:11,370 --> 00:23:12,711
[SPEAKER_03]: I would think it depends.

229
00:23:12,811 --> 00:23:14,332
[SPEAKER_03]: I guess, yeah, it could work.

230
00:23:14,592 --> 00:23:20,476
[SPEAKER_03]: But I think what can also result in, it's basically mixing like the two different approaches.

231
00:23:22,035 --> 00:23:37,331
[SPEAKER_03]: Although they will individually arrive at the same, either take your sense of self and undermine it with the present situation, or with the earth, or whatever, or even if you take this body in its extent, like this situation, this body, and that earth, that in between will be where your sense of self is.

232
00:23:39,013 --> 00:23:44,597
[SPEAKER_03]: So, if you set it up correctly, it cannot remain unaffected, in other words.

233
00:23:44,917 --> 00:23:48,780
[SPEAKER_03]: But yes, sometimes this will feel clearer, sometimes something else will feel clearer.

234
00:23:48,800 --> 00:23:58,006
[SPEAKER_03]: But the point is to keep trying to pretty much revoke and maintain that same direct principle inside of... that undermines itself.

235
00:23:58,466 --> 00:24:04,871
[SPEAKER_03]: That doesn't require the owner, the master, the center, your center-self to be there, witnessing, observing, experiencing, and so on.

236
00:24:05,011 --> 00:24:07,112
[SPEAKER_03]: No, it's kind of stretched in between the two.

237
00:24:07,152 --> 00:24:09,194
[SPEAKER_03]: And you realize, well, if either of these changes...

238
00:24:11,020 --> 00:24:12,341
[SPEAKER_03]: My sense of self cannot remain.

239
00:24:12,361 --> 00:24:13,341
[SPEAKER_03]: Thus, it's not mine.

240
00:24:13,882 --> 00:24:14,722
[SPEAKER_03]: How can it be mine?

241
00:24:15,103 --> 00:24:21,286
[SPEAKER_03]: Or, this sense of self is the master controller of this great experience, except that it's neither the master nor in control of it.

242
00:24:21,967 --> 00:24:23,087
[SPEAKER_03]: So, it's a star system.

243
00:24:23,728 --> 00:24:24,508
[SPEAKER_03]: So, what is it then?

