00:24:24,608 --> 00:24:25,549
[SPEAKER_03]: It doesn't matter what it is.

245
00:24:25,589 --> 00:24:31,353
[SPEAKER_03]: What matters is that you keep confusing it as your subject, as your ownership, and so on.

246
00:24:31,773 --> 00:24:33,434
[SPEAKER_03]: Remove that, then you'll see what it is.

247
00:24:37,207 --> 00:24:39,949
[SPEAKER_03]: I mean, I can give an answer, but then people say, okay, that's what the self is.

248
00:24:40,109 --> 00:24:41,050
