250
00:24:44,233 --> 00:24:51,759
[SPEAKER_03]: The point is to remove that ownership through setting up correctly that necessary basis for its presence that cannot be your sense of self at the same time.

251
00:24:52,119 --> 00:24:53,921
[SPEAKER_03]: Yet, your sense of self fully sits upon it.

252
00:25:00,186 --> 00:25:02,247
