00:25:52,676 --> 00:25:58,357
[SPEAKER_03]: And so, yeah, okay, well, if I see this sufficiently enough, those things will be recognized there on their own, because that's where they are.

263
00:25:59,478 --> 00:26:10,261
[SPEAKER_03]: Sometimes, you might not be able to recollect the element of earth accurately, so you start with your body situation, and then discern the element of earth through this body, not as something left, right, before or after.

