328
00:30:11,796 --> 00:30:12,256
[SPEAKER_03]: Nothing else.

329
00:30:15,576 --> 00:30:17,857
[SPEAKER_03]: And then, that's the true unburdening, basically.

330
00:30:19,237 --> 00:30:25,398
[SPEAKER_03]: Because there is now no more of that assumed center that takes all the weight on.

331
00:30:32,090 --> 00:30:51,248
